{"study_accession":"PRJEB11844","secondary_study_accession":"ERP013260","title":"Transcriptional landscape of human tissue lymphocytes unveils\nuniqueness of tumor-infiltrating T regulatory cells","description":"To assess the gene expression landscape of tumor infiltrating CD4+ T cells, we isolated different CD4+ lymphocytes subsets from two different tumors, NSCLC and CRC, from the adjacent normal tissues, and from peripheral blood samples. From all these tissues, we purified by flow cytometry CD4+ Treg (36 samples from 18 individuals), Th1 (30 samples from 21 individuals) and Th17 (22 samples from 14 individuals) cells. The polyadenylated RNA fraction extracted from the sorted CD4+ Treg, Th1 and Th17 cells was then analyzed by paired-end RNA sequencing.","pubmed":"","geo_series":"","n_samples":2,"samples":[{"sample_accession":"SAMEA3719503","study_accession":"PRJEB11844","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"SQ_0391 Treg Peripheral Blood","description":"Treg Peripheral Blood","sex":"","geo_sample":"","access":"open","dbgap":"","n_runs":1,"first_public":"2016-11-14","attributes":[["ENA-CHECKLIST","ERC000011"],["bio_material","Peripheral Blood"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2016-11-14T17:10:37Z"],["organism","Homo sapiens"],["ENA-LAST-UPDATE","2017-02-20T09:04:35Z"],["scientific_name","Homo sapiens"],["common name","human"],["cell_type","Treg"],["age","na"],["patient_code","b1"],["ENA-FIRST-PUBLIC","2016-11-14"],["ENA-LAST-UPDATE","2017-02-20"]],"runs":[{"run_accession":"ERR1198174","experiment_accession":"ERX1270432","library_layout":"PAIRED","library_selection":"RANDOM","instrument_model":"Illumina HiSeq 2500","read_count":61468618,"base_count":7683577250,"first_public":"2016-11-14","experiment_title":"Illumina HiSeq 2500 paired end sequencing"}],"labels":[],"single_cell":false},{"sample_accession":"SAMEA3719504","study_accession":"PRJEB11844","blood_class":"blood_cells","class_from":"sample","title":"SQ_0392 Treg Peripheral Blood","description":"Treg